## Product Page Checklist — OpenCart Demo

### Preconditions
- [ ] Application is accessible
- [ ] User is on the main page
- [ ] At least one product is available

---

### Product Page Navigation
- [ ] User can open product page from the main page
- [ ] Product page opens successfully
- [ ] URL changes according to selected product

---

### Product Information
- [ ] Product name is displayed
- [ ] Product image is displayed
- [ ] Product price is displayed
- [ ] Product description is displayed

---

### Add to Cart Section
- [ ] Add to Cart button is displayed
- [ ] User can add product to cart
- [ ] Success message is displayed after adding product
- [ ] Cart icon updates product quantity

---

### Quantity Field
- [ ] Quantity field is displayed
- [ ] User can change product quantity
- [ ] Quantity accepts numeric values only

---

### UI & Layout
- [ ] Product page layout is not broken
- [ ] All elements are visible and readable
- [ ] Page is displayed correctly in desktop browser

---

### Negative Scenarios (basic)
- [ ] Add to Cart without selecting required options (if applicable)
- [ ] Proper error message is displayed

---

### Product Image
- [ ] Product image loads correctly

